    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "I see. some people argue that the differences aren't just social, but that there's actual data from IQ tests that shows these gaps between different racial groups. if someone were to argue that these disparities are proof of innate biological differences, what specific data points or studies would they typically point to? can you elaborate on those specific arguments?",
