      "content": "thanks for the detail. so if we're looking at it from a purely \"biological\" standpoint, how do these arguments typically explain why certain populations seem to have more \"intellectual\" or \"civilizational\" success than others? like, if those IQ gaps are real and genetic, how does that theory connect to the way different races have historically developed or organized their societies?",
